							Hello,<br />
       Sadly, I have bad news to report. Due to real life responsibilities I can no longer involve myself with Everquest. I am officially promoting Laun to Leader, Laun may/will choose the new Second. I will be enclosing a copy of everything involving the Recruits. Don't worry, it'll be ok. You can stop crying now. <br />
<br />
                                   Tolden<br />
