From:  &quot;James Jones&quot; &lt;wizziepants@hotmail.com&gt;  <br />
<br />
Greetings fellow light bringer. I am eager to get some info on your guild's recruiting requirements, because i am interested in joining a serious guild. I love to role play and i have been playing EQ for over a year now so i am pretty exp and i think i could bring a lot to the guild as far as knowledge,playing skill, role play, comic relief, encouragement, etc. I am a big team player and i love guilds. I will always do whatever i can to help a guild mate in need even if it means dropping what i am doing to do it. I hope that i can get a chance to prove my skills to you and maybe, if you are impressed, i could be a member of your fine guild and if my talents were needed, even an officer. Another thing you might find useful is that i am VERY exp on pvp as my main chars were on rallos and saryrn. As of now i plan to play a HIE wizzie with my RL friend playing a HIE chanter. We have been playing together like 4ever so if there is an opening for him that would be great. Anyways i hope i am at least considered and if you could at least take the time to mail me back at least some info on the guild and if you think maybe i am what this guild needs. Walk with pride my brother and let Tunare guide your path. <br />
<br />
-Wizard of Light- <br />
<br />
Pker <br />
<br />
