From:  &quot;sulloneq&quot; &lt;sulloneq@wanadoo.fr&gt;  <br />
<br />
Hello, <br />
 <br />
Will play on Sullon server on the Good Side (druid or enchanter, not really sure yet) and wondering whether to join or create a guild...Our side is quite likely to be the weakest one(among others : limited number of races, no safe newbie zone &amp; worst class/race options for druids &amp; pally) so unity is needed....this is why I would like to know a bit more about eternal life...<br />
 <br />
What I am looking for is a &quot;Hard Line&quot; good guild centred on :<br />
- strong commitment to guildmates (such as no taxes/thithes but keeping words &amp; runes for guildmates and helping each others for questson a regular basis)<br />
- strong commitment to the war vs evil &amp; newt (why not declaring Kelethim &amp; felwith a GOOD only area)<br />
- a European component (being French myself, i would preffer having more than a few guildmates logged on when I am playing)...If this is a problem, as long as above points are satisfied, I could act as recruiting officer to be sure I can pick up European people when I meet them.<br />
 <br />
Does that correspond to your guild or...?<br />
 <br />
Thanks<br />
 <br />
